{"ref":"BDB, דָּאַג","hw":"דָּאַג","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּאַג</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. be anxious, concerned, fear (</strong>Talm. <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּאֵיג</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּאִג</span> <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְדָאַג</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.5\">1 S 9:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.2\">10:2</a>; 2 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּאַגְתְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.11\">Is 57:11</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִדְאָ֑ג</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">Je 17:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶדְאַג</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:19\" href=\"/Psalms.38.19\">ψ 38:19</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּאֵג</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.19\">Je 38:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּאֲגִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.16\">Je 42:16</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>be anxious, concerned</em>, with reference to, in behalf of, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.5\">1 S 9:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.2\">10:2</a>; <em>id.</em> c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.16\">Je 42:16</a> (famine personif.); sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵחַטָּאתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:19\" href=\"/Psalms.38.19\">ψ 38:19</a>; <em>be anxious</em>, abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">Je 17:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֵא</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <strong> fear, dread</strong>, sq. acc. of pers. feared <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.11\">Is 57:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֵא</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.19\">Je 38:19</a> (where also sq. cl. with <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּן</span>).","next":"BDB, דֹּאֵג","prev":"BDB, דְּאָבוֹן"}